OL,3,GNEWSAClosed pick-your-own farm's giant 
OL,4,Astrawberry sold                        
OL,6,FA giant fibreglass strawberry that took
OL,7,Fpride of place at a pick-your-own farm 
OL,8,Fhas been sold through an online auction
OL,9,Ffor nearly #3,800.                     
OL,11,FGrays Farm in Wokingham, Berkshire,    
OL,12,Fwhich has been recognised by           
OL,13,Fgenerations for the 10ft by 8ft (3m by 
OL,14,F2.4m) fruit, was run by the Gray family
OL,15,Ffrom 1969 and open to the public since 
OL,16,F1973.                                  
OL,18,FRun initially by Donald Gray, the farm 
OL,19,Fhad been looked after by their son     
OL,20,FPeter, his wife Elizabeth and their son
OL,21,FPaul, over recent years.               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
